open task
.IP [x] 4
done task
.SS Examples
.RS 4
.nf
mrq render \-o man mrq.1.md > mrq.1
\&.not a request
\*(Aqnot one either
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
indented code \\fB stays literal
.fi
.RE
